um (from miʹnus, “less”)."}]}],"29711":[{"footnoteId":10889,"paragraphs":[{"pid":48,"text":"Or, “faith.”"}]}],"29719":[{"footnoteId":10890,"paragraphs":[{"pid":49,"text":"See App 5B."}]}],"29722":[{"footnoteId":10891,"paragraphs":[{"pid":50,"text":"Or, “the holding sacred (treating as holy).” Gr., ho ha·gi·a·smosʹ; Lat., sanc·ti·fi·caʹti·o."}]},{"footnoteId":10892,"paragraphs":[{"pid":51,"text":"See App 5A."}]}],"29724":[{"footnoteId":10893,"paragraphs":[{"pid":52,"text":"Lit., “not in passion of desire.”"}]}],"29725":[{"footnoteId":10894,"paragraphs":[{"pid":53,"text":"See App 1D."}]}],"29726":[{"footnoteId":10895,"paragraphs":[{"pid":54,"text":"Or, “filthiness; depravity; lewdness.” Gr., a·ka·thar·siʹai, dative, sing.; J22(Heb.), letum·ʼahʹ, “for uncleanness.”"}]}],"29728":[{"footnoteId":10896,"paragraphs":[{"pid":55,"text":"“God,” אABVg; J17, “Jehovah.”"}]}],"29734":[{"footnoteId":10897,"paragraphs":[{"pid":56,"text":"See App 1D."}]},{"footnoteId":10898,"paragraphs":[{"pid":57,"text":"“The Lord,” אAVg; B, “Jesus.”"}]}],"29735":[{"footnoteId":10899,"paragraphs":[{"pid":58,"text":"“The Lord,” אABVg; J7,8,13,14, “Jehovah.”"}]}],"29736":[{"footnoteId":10900,"paragraphs":[{"pid":59,"text":"Lit., “the (ones) being left around.” See App 5D."}]},{"footnoteId":10901,"paragraphs":[{"pid":60,"text":"Or, “at the same time.”"}]},{"footnoteId":10902,"paragraphs":[{"pid":61,"text":"“The Lord,” אABVg; J7,8, “Jehovah.”"}]},{"footnoteId":10903,"paragraphs":[{"pid":62,"text":"“Lord,” אABVg; J7,8,13,14,24, “Jehovah.”"}]}],"29738":[{"footnoteId":10904,"paragraphs":[{"pid":63,"text":"Or, “appointed times.” Gr., kai·ronʹ."}]}],"29739":[{"footnoteId":10905,"paragraphs":[{"pid":64,"text":"See App 1D."}]}],"29741":[{"footnoteId":10906,"paragraphs":[{"pid":65,"text":"“Overtake you as it would thieves,” AB; אDItVgSyh,pArm, “overtake you as a thief.”"}]}],"29743":[{"footnoteId":10907,"paragraphs":[{"pid":66,"text":"Lit., “and may we be sober.”"}]}],"29746":[{"footnoteId":10908,"paragraphs":[